{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1496,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de2e2c376074fcbfb8493df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2452670a30426d87a4d948ebde001f06e583a789f5f8d913ea33347f767de96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2451d8c42e75d01ad4b509",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e850be378bdf5a0209875ba59221208332eff2bb0ec0f59d887ef8fd12cfa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c66507daa5983421541069ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65bda3e4804f46ed70197c5ef2281d1e5ad51cbe99f4b35590bcdbd0698abc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f288452d5e314c0732dc41eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つながっている…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd3dba38652bd30e2a0c41fb8dbc648a8f9466c1155757f435876eb187a269ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb551265c75866e57f50702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やった…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b01e1e05d3a405f18bfd0bcf6a12cadfe19d5acaa167fc6f383e5af8d1c99ea1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7531de37178e1b35198065eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このまま…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acda11606c602bc9e3c5a554410f7e5ea29c7244febc1c2d9caebb74b00eaf68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a7f779f038658f959666cf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdeae8d48e5fa9ab91b63d06b76a026d262e2266fa9b0b84812e952bf3bce651",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0908484ded49187581c3225f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふー…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "313f8a00d0b096f43982cd532adb40c2b1dbfec5c14cea31513d2476b8f8b4e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3398021a7d95930f579cfa9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やらないのか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc90fac77e34d891bd5a77ed77ac74cc440f1d5f305a8f71433a8d2ffd9ca04e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4474a56e5e6b8f29b9c80773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7625dcd9bf18fb2d67772784c57633cb3e0dfb259e0424141c5c63dda4290845",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07a34857c2e951bec410e76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d3e5f5f0582b2a21d0f86c22b551c167ae6e481619c57ccf6d904aba02eff30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36093af121fadc08b6f408ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日はこれだそうだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24bd97c38bdf972767f7f128c14f0796acc441b5daf74b8916a179b602756042",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcba7ff2c3287533b828c4a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…休息を提案する。このままでは、\r\nパフォーマンスに悪影響を及ぼす。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7783224b30f904cad86a3836d75d6d19900689d1b9b0bd67043521bc05e9fe34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e9d16ed12ea79deb8d6817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…今のまま動いても、\r\n成果は期待できない。\r\n1度立て直したほうがいい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c4cb4a398d935b14a165e426fa082bac668a0e48e489b75012d43e31134a1aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f281aee8a1dd8b497b0e575e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…全ての感覚が噛み合っている。\r\n普段よりハードなトレーニングも\r\n問題なくこなせるだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2d00b20b8e2e63d10b2156e54bdbf34b499e4554a2fbc57cc70d6882619125b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909dba1bd3b904cb017bec01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華々しく、歴史に名を遺した\r\n先人たちと同じ――いや、\r\nそれ以上の高みを目指して…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c8a604aa3dbed222ccdef553b05ff70b3e5b54c06dd49af7ef48b406b7e4f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f881cc73211ac8d4e542b8b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少しコース取りを変えてみたい。\r\nスパートをかける位置も――\r\n最適解を、とことん突き詰めたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64aaf6812d6e0cdde104165d4ae6fe3a41370d1ff44812027737c8823adee891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1abf578240a1ccd133d052d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強として君臨するため\r\n――始めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faca7267e77ad1407a2c55c41350e902cde5201bff0564aabe67d0223b275e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf720032eeaa0fe8638d610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常に、為すべきを為す。\r\n父も、祖父も。たゆまぬ努力の末に\r\n前人未到の結果を残した。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b058ee467d7aae2823468a7269a54bc5a38065840617dca9c962296e16fe62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16c88884916d02053b247a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒ぶりもせず、静まりかえることも\r\nなく――ただ、為すべきことを為す",
      "source_fingerprint": "468ed707e5dc53856a81611739cf73e2f91a5f9738c71a8271ceb05031f33140",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea07a85cd6d0834ecff4e1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふー…、気にしないでくれ。\r\n瞑想をしていた…。\r\n少し、雑念が多くてな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e8364a753c44fa413562278dce6f2604b0c5a1fc6cf13b577fe8bf38ff880e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a174c9de9b1d5519837cc129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テンポの速い曲を聴くと、\r\nトレーニング前の心構えができる。\r\n…だが、効果が感じられない…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1986a0a6f7dd8e37a98ec9665fb2a4fe54f3b20879bbb64eefde698d0a96654c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bba2061d7bcf9da8e41fa43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…余所に気を取られるな。\r\n集中だ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b055628fbe127d6f5c7f32c35ab25de8620ede783005b0382df8a86a1afa1670",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9458bed534f907a209841b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すまない、すぐに準備をする…\r\n…はー、すー…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d410531d11c0491bb3e231c047c371eedbbb7564da5d283c7c2f97a367be71f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfc0273afd83d6aed1960a2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ここのところ出走が続いている。\r\n脚やメンタルに負担がかかるし…\r\nこの後の調整が長引かないだろうか",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0123a35de8dfd9b675244f4f0c277c8c26827c264f4f28ed78e16edb15c624",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d8377bc383c5303c953a62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…すでに溜まった疲労や出走による\r\nリスクは、無視できないレベルだ。\r\n危険だが…本当に、挑むのか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb27694834c61b29bafde1c908692163f2dd5bb0f92be60214bbe688e3481e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f662fd0f11ebee760ce3ccb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚が弾む、心拍数も申し分ない…\r\nこれなら、最高のパフォーマンスを\r\n発揮できるだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "406916ade295952e9dbab15adbfcd6d1a61b247d428d3f90478691d1c1326254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecc0f16d7e36f9d789ea7340",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限りなく理想に近い、と言えるな。\r\n――行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c2a4e31702be5654d56b1eab27fc72ca46f1b08df228681449ebc6d29937e02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae904fb0fc72eef13afd3463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒々しく、激しく――\r\n鼓動が高鳴るままに、いざ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3509039f9ab2a68612c09420799ea3d15465ba152456f0608181afddfb81c9f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ce85fb9526fe3a1f2b2137",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整は上々だ。あとは、\r\nこの血に宿る力を信じる…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4563a618527f25438b045bbfedbb474e5b9af9864a8f12a22f3d4dc6109c9631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:856a88effbb9cc02b9cd017c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "結果で示そう、“最強”を――\r\n私という、結晶を。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d17b870ebc63b6e8cc7cbcaf986bdf3d1c321338d37a3eaa75cd71782d7c201",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ffaaa436e1405b3bad7f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一族の者として、\r\n誇れる結果を出す。\r\n滾る、この血に誓って――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3dce4bdbb761b4351a464a4e235f6e7ac55358183b6102daf90835065ed1ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9626f478ce690f57d4811197",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子は可もなく、不可もなく――\r\nされど、最強は変わらずあらねば。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd472b7a232297c3a9449b45cf750681f3dcd846840c90117fd3e29bff0e8fa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7864e216d26b6811b83313d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整に問題はない。\r\n積み重ねたトレーニングが\r\nそのまま力として表れるだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e32580279efee296692b7b6edd3fd08c5176a265c12ffbbfd2965880bff86f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02ffb6e3a45f5507ad1dc11a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子は悪くない。\r\nとにかく力まず、落ち着いて…\r\nいや、気にしすぎないように、だな",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9ca008c0404ac247af482eeb5612525a639f9c0c5c5ce86a542424df56d642c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38721c7e58fe4fc366c07ba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整は間に合わなかった、が…\r\n期待は、裏切れない…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "928090554394a8b27c0bae9b1d39dec4f006495296f07414dbb3ccf3709cbe3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bdbcf932b36ce353adde7a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ふー…っ。\r\n少し…力みを感じる。\r\n本番までに整えねば…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "666b8ed2e1411f3cd483fed6502958f9deedf0a7671dc7135f845b9cac3bdd7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9488708b4662fbca04594fa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少し、集中が乱れているが…\r\n努力は裏切らない。…そのはずだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94c542566e24251587284f64469f08bd926c1f970574a5186bc9fb2e69e39942",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:798056fde0689945b670d181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子が整わなくても、\r\n本番は待ってくれない…。\r\n――不完全、だとしても。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1441deed6b9caf451be5cc5f9761ffdae684c0629aba232fb1ba306e8792ab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404037f08f6ad09d77c621e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…結果を、出さねば。\r\n一族の名に、恥じぬよう…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec68a9b05d4b7c344bc7ecbf050987af9cfcd5e45da4966a474c04c85f958d13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92a634eddeeebbf979e5367d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不甲斐ない結果は、残せない。\r\nどうであっても…絶対に…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eacbd772dbcaa7f738b8a4d82678f001beb9a290f9320fe1825016799216748e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1042bfacfa2a8e3a62aa9ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はあぁっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db808f86fc35ebaadcb2fa3046aa4fff77415d5f35a9b6b2c9a13db281598dfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2814a20bca541a09436d09fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "了解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0157e6aed55c5c02d6a5db10de6381ff48cf5d42afdf83c802629cb18e71b92a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86dd504a6cb1b491b9306e87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "問題ない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db7c7b78ad65e987b812441a734e916f4d80351c09c6d771945b9d372dae468",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4756db939f3fb0bc9715dc23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "座学か。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f4f63eed2829b395b9ea0aaf1c09fa3bee86fbddc698c9b3cfd1080bc9eb893",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1cb1914ecb8628c6e2dac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くっ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bca6da8ecb6aaeab02e5a22863fa5110f97d666065235a519e4697647e7f875",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb4e243157036411e61150d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "むむぅ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef45ef88156881af96dd5cdfc87486bd43db4575d273873953fed44b83a3e4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de91bbf9783385b3a1b8a6d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出発しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa26acbdefc5d7ef8c49e7ab933e46216b6c5b68ab2b665d390efcca9389e3ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:755d68d70383652e1bae22dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海か…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b8f44a2c222c54c538f40b2a27dd7ebbb0e8e05592f4dc3f87dfe0dd44ce4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfa079a45db3af863aeb467d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道を示してくれて、感謝する。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e3b243c69d48df90c8b7940d5562837b7e61b4be843efd20b926f213ac0ecaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ae2a45a41ac1d2790cdfbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここまで、ありがとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c05ddc3a4d28128cf744badcdc36bffe1c5ec6e05f1a8b4b6c748b1567b243f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1a14e9ac90c5203b74a6aad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少々荒々しくいくぞ――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e722aab1f6dbbe0f16b4385e4119e7eda3d74549459c5dc60fecc6fe0aa9409",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a1bfe10061a740a327b2974",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――行くぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b634c90ec573c26f2178b0dfccba2781e89e83c241b070606c9bb70b37092829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed2ab2ff27627c105decaea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒々しく、征こう――",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d51d4ddbc95c05d3227745afb64c7ab7940119e9253d5d9a759a881dbf93cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f56a53fcaf5ffc7519dba435",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここまで、ありがとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c05ddc3a4d28128cf744badcdc36bffe1c5ec6e05f1a8b4b6c748b1567b243f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3acaded8cf60eb31ee87855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一族の者として、\r\n誇れる結果を出す。\r\n滾る、この血に誓って――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3dce4bdbb761b4351a464a4e235f6e7ac55358183b6102daf90835065ed1ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49231fb7861a1e9fb32e5dcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒々しく、激しく――\r\n鼓動が高鳴るままに、いざ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3509039f9ab2a68612c09420799ea3d15465ba152456f0608181afddfb81c9f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b0f98ac575bde43221422be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここまで、ありがとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c05ddc3a4d28128cf744badcdc36bffe1c5ec6e05f1a8b4b6c748b1567b243f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d2c82b8807c5a1211188bb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "問題ない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db7c7b78ad65e987b812441a734e916f4d80351c09c6d771945b9d372dae468",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a4d09f16dff91b0a285d974",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…届かなかった…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17a11e5cf515160401efdfc659d042693b64939131c8b02e918a84791f44d3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d98a44d9cd6fc0515bfcc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…っ、力不足か…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e59956baa025835510112e23080d7af08c20d9ebe549d2eb1135c25037bb049a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514b040bf678d17d914959ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "入着が、関の山だと…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d0332178d9396d144141dcd09ed9f31afe1442c6f35f95daa056ab027ba74e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f63a5f65e590ebbbf79c92f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強とは、程遠い…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dae7574c71d0f62b74b910a470352f9c179928a72c9fb5a9aa4f37dd914fdbaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d323075f2994af046495ab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰もが信じて疑わない。\r\nそれが、“最強”というものだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d480658b624d5b2926cbd792a7d1fdd664409013cde7da666b1b742eb9b144b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693dd6040968922db5ad086e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強を示す――故に、当然の結果だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d7ce22cd07a1e3b6a79103a20125780f1b51acc3f399765ad01e62cdeb1022",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a2cd4b84bf7b5715cbbc14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――“圧倒的”に…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5cb18d84c8fa8f022ae25705254abaf8351e3577a5bed843390241400b73d9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeffce766cd93f6df3f139e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今、貫く――最強を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a37bd9da67c5da1c0ce2d49bece745db3d9fb085b03a4422270252648850b37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfda3b598d45dcaa9ae22307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強を示す…。\r\n『ファンサ』でも、だ。\r\nそれが私の使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fcf28e2177a62b69f6733bbbb5d57a38fcdaa587ad304e5c25307f4e402b91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df90104b7a550fe61c264cd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在大自然区域徒步旅行，在大海里\n远泳……  真想把这次假期过成\n名副其实的度假胜地式的理想假期。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab8f445192fee5c29b58dcfff89b7d7b309a745046486f0ddf8a2ae4d480e98c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc019b6f5b2e02aeab8b723f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骏逸说要为心境的变化而添置新泳衣\n真有趣……如果能一起去的话，\n说不定能学到些什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52f4b42f6aa35cc31253c700f5d3b1b323ed12e6e2cb8da8871e6ef7d2388c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb214a8fd5a99ae1d1c424e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰もが、誰かの…。きっと父も\r\n祖父もそうだったのだろう…。\r\nいつか詳しく聞いてみよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "590f05b445e723cdcefccb86b7a77c433e6403086d923703275348f857aab9e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ea2582f45d945c486d73dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先人たちの記憶を継いだ、栄光の結晶。\r\n今こそ示そう――我が脚、我が力ッ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "083fdb5d393b469618c8fe50cbb0466cfa748ff14eada4b707077b196488ceb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df01af82f201e54acdcbd5a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个VR温泉乒乓球……  \n居然还要计算球台的磨损来决定战术……  \n如果还有机会的话，我会征服世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "846fbb9e8f4b1e8e2844757b35f0ea573930a54bae0a696c65d53dd6056366f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1faf808ed450456ef91b50ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "威風堂々、最強らしく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28bcde03fa0e40e885972b2c7577eb60e06a3c75a0566615cded0ab5175e449e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368017a2eea740dc4d669bd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧にこなしてみせよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81176f90b006487f772a92297e069c3ff5cc3784897dec3facf5a5a2eda126bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c5adca8617fb2e5dcf4e0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "証明しよう、“最強”を。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3faa9bd96227d06b0502e656662aa40beebab5d5c58a0fbff224effb86a144c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03caa891c8d1e84610ea7544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――まだ、緊張はする。\r\nけれど、気負いすぎはしない。\r\n気づかせてくれてありがとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f9568a7781bf5d4f4125e8949f04607839a1e3dca1c453523de487ce451b595",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8abd643235352e2f70c7fb93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着こなしは正しく、清潔に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98bb472798e7e951c459e90e766c4c64f581d306318030af4f4e86ada46d79fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cbd48916351cde4ff8aca0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パフォーマンスに抜かりはない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad5f4780b54a91f10026f01211229c97167b57aae167528647df025d44fad1c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5d84e1a44fcd461e958905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この決意のように、\r\n揺るぎない黒を纏い――いざ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7327f778bf6cff524b30dd8b5c153ac5b6397077b5fae46f45b9008a0edc54a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
